OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity proposes cutting 145   
OL,4,Ajobs amid deficit                      
OL,6,FMore than 140 jobs are at risk at a    
OL,7,Funiversity that says it is facing      
OL,8,Findustry-wide financial pressures.     
OL,10,FBournemouth University (BU) said it was
OL,11,Fconsulting on proposals to cut 145     
OL,12,Froles across academic and professional 
OL,13,Fservices staff.                        
OL,15,FThe University and College Union (UCU) 
OL,16,Fsaid, in addition to the redundancies, 
OL,17,Fabout 30 programmes would also be      
OL,18,Fclosed or merged.                      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
