OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity proposes cutting 145   
OL,4,Ajobs amid deficit                      
OL,6,FThe university said it was "saddened at
OL,7,Fthe prospect of losing valued          
OL,8,Fcolleagues", but denied the changes    
OL,9,Fwould lead to course closures.         
